    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12466299/comment/12876079",
          "id": "12876079",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ryantxu",
            "name": "ryantxu",
            "key": "ryantxu",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Ryan McKinley",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "body": "this lets lucene get built as 'lucene-3.1-dev' and builds solr as a -SNAPSHOT, but references the lucene jars.\n\n{code:xml}\n<dependency>\n  <groupId>org.apache.lucene</groupId>\n  <artifactId>lucene-spatial</artifactId>\n-  <version>2.9.1</version>\n+  <version>@lucene_maven_version@</version>\n</dependency>\n{code}",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ryantxu",
            "name": "ryantxu",
            "key": "ryantxu",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Ryan McKinley",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "created": "2010-06-06T19:44:23.315+0000",
          "updated": "2010-06-06T19:44:23.315+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12466299/comment/12878828",
          "id": "12878828",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ryantxu",
            "name": "ryantxu",
            "key": "ryantxu",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Ryan McKinley",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "body": "This patch swaps \"-dev\" for \"-SNAPSHOT\" and references the version consistently across lucene and solr.\n\nWith this patch you can run:\nant generate-maven-artifacts and it builds the same version for lucene and solr",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ryantxu",
            "name": "ryantxu",
            "key": "ryantxu",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Ryan McKinley",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "created": "2010-06-15T02:18:38.574+0000",
          "updated": "2010-06-15T02:18:38.574+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12466299/comment/12879566",
          "id": "12879566",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sarowe",
            "name": "sarowe",
            "key": "steve_rowe",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258"
            },
            "displayName": "Steven Rowe",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Ryan, why is it necessary to switch from -dev to -SNAPSHOT?  Maven can deal with -dev as a version suffix, can't it?\n\nI ask because I'm looking at adding functionality in Lucene and Solr to install Maven jars in the user's local repository, and I was planning on going the route of making everything -dev.\n\nI'll add a link here after I make an issue and put up a patch.\n\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sarowe",
            "name": "sarowe",
            "key": "steve_rowe",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258"
            },
            "displayName": "Steven Rowe",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2010-06-16T22:48:58.071+0000",
          "updated": "2010-06-16T22:48:58.071+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12466299/comment/12879569",
          "id": "12879569",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ryantxu",
            "name": "ryantxu",
